id: searx-auto-release-clean-tree
title: Keep Auto Release runner output outside the checkout
description: Prevent workflow output capture from violating the release pipeline clean-worktree precondition.
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 0
tags[3]: github-actions,regression,release
created_at: "2026-07-21T18:18:55.364Z"
