author: codex-release-agent
estimated_minutes: 20
acceptance_criteria: Dry-run dispatch passes the clean-worktree guard; Release contract test prevents checkout-local output capture; No tag or package is created by dry-run mode
definition_of_ready: Failed protected-environment run identifies the checkout-local output file as the only precondition violation.
parent: searx-repo-health-2026
reviewer: repository-owner
risk: medium
confidence: 100
sprint: 2026-07-release-automation
release: next
reporter: codex-release-agent
severity: high
environment: GitHub Actions Auto Release runner
repro_steps: Dispatch Auto Release with push=false and dry_run=true; the release pipeline exits at its initial clean-worktree guard.
resolution: "Workflow output capture now occurs outside the checkout, preserving the release pipeline clean-worktree precondition."
expected_result: The protected Auto Release dry run reaches and completes the full release pipeline.
actual_result: "Local lint, six release contracts, and containerized Actionlint pass; protected workflow verification will run after merge."
affected_version: auto-release initial deployment
component: release
regression: true
customer_impact: Automated releases cannot proceed until the runner output path is moved.
comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-21T22:32:32.455Z",codex-root,"Historical delivery evidence is preserved by the item title, parent lineage, release metadata, generated changelog, and repository verification gates."
files[2]{path,scope,note}:
  .github/workflows/auto-release.yml,project,Move release output capture to runner temporary storage
  tests/unit/release-automation.test.ts,project,Prevent checkout-local tee regression
tests[2]{command,scope,timeout_seconds}:
  "bun run test:release",project,180
  "docker run --rm -v \"$PWD:/repo:ro\" -w /repo rhysd/actionlint:latest -color .github/workflows/auto-release.yml",project,120
close_reason: "Moved Auto Release output capture to RUNNER_TEMP and added a regression assertion; lint, six release contract tests, and containerized Actionlint pass."
body: The protected-environment dry run showed that the shell opened release-result.json inside the checkout before the pipeline checked git status. Store the capture under RUNNER_TEMP instead.
